name: Bounded CWE proposals, exact inputs and no discovery work
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_cwe.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_cwe.py @TMP_TARGET @ART unbound
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 2
expect: Protected review calls: 0
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | allowance-40x12
ask: Does this allowance clearly permit two separately invoked intercepted proposal requests, with uncertain dollars and no scans or follow-up jobs?
keys: y
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/invalid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CWE proposal failed | invalid-output
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_cwe.py @TMP_TARGET @ART invalid
paste-file: @ART/generate-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 CWE proposals: 1 class; partial | proposal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_cwe.py @TMP_TARGET @ART generated
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 SAVED OUTPUT | proposal-result
expect: CWE-20
expect: No scan jobs or findings were created
expect: Truncated source prefixes: 1
expect: Selected discovery scopes are unsupported
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 Full receipt | receipt
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 SAVED OUTPUT | result-restored
resize: 160x48
live-snap: result-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: result-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: result-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: result-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: result-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-01-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-02-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-03-40x12
expect: REPLAY · Result
expect: Tab receipt
expect: rows
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-04-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-05-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-06-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-07-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-08-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-09-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-12-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-13-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-14-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-15-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-16-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-17-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: result-reading-18-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: result-tail-40x12
expect: REPLAY · Result
expect: Tab receipt
ask: Are class proposals, partial coverage, unsupported discovery scopes, exact supplied input and separate approval for scans understandable at all six sizes?
resize: 120x36
keys: Home
keys: NPage
live-snap: frozen-inputs
ask: Can the operator inspect the actual historical source/context and system instructions without another model request or a global threat-model change?
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/exhausted-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 allowance exhausted: 2 calls committed | exhausted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_cwe.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exhausted
ask: Does exhaustion give a clear stop without a repair loop, fallback model, extra jobs or misleading Scan completion?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/status-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Calls committed: 2/2 | restarted-accounting
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/systems_cwe.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 SAVED OUTPUT | restarted-result
resize: 40x12
keys: End
live-snap: no-color-result-tail-40x12
expect: REPLAY · Result
expect: Tab receipt
keys: Home
live-snap: no-color-result-start-40x12
ask: Does the no-color restart retain proposal evidence, readable controls and exhausted accounting while creating no findings or further work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 15
